"1"
"        --  Dictionary  --"
"HP = Hit Points (Your health)"
"Gold = Currency used in shops"
"Level = Your growth tier (XP)"
"Weapon/Armor = gear + bonus"
"More Dictionary.",2
"Read Hints.",5
"Exit Help.",0
"2"
"Total Attack = weapon + level"
"Total Defense = armor + level"
"Large/Small Heal = restore HP"
"Antidote = cures Poison/Rot"
"Agility Potion = flee a fight"
"More Dictionary.",3
"Read Hints.",5
"Exit Help.",0
"3"
"Special Enemy Trait to watch:"
"Poison/Rot - some foes poison"
"you on hit, dealing damage"
"each turn until cured by an"
"Antidote or a night's rest."
"More Dictionary.",4
"Read Hints.",5
"Exit Help.",0
"4"
"Defeat 5 of a foe to unlock"
"its stats in your Bestiary."
" "
"Gaining levels, buying gear,"
"and stocking herbs are your"
"Read Hints.",5
"Go Back to Start.",1
"Exit Help.",0
"5"
"        --  Hints  --"
"Fountains: drink to heal 5 HP."
"Free, and works any time."
"Barrels: search them! Some"
"hide gold, potions, or junk."
"More Hints.",6
"Read Dictionary.",1
"Exit Help.",0
"6"
"Fishing: face water and cast."
"You may catch a fish, a rare"
"fish, or a bag of coins. Sell"
"your catch at any shop for"
"easy gold."
"More Hints.",7
"Read Dictionary.",1
"Exit Help.",0
"7"
"Leveling: defeat foes for XP."
"Watch your Xp bar fill up -"
"each Level gained adds +1 to"
"both Attack and Defense."
"Stronger foes give more XP."
"More Hints.",8
"Read Dictionary.",1
"Exit Help.",0
"8"
"Gear: shops sell weapons,"
"armor, and potions. Inns heal"
"you fully for a little gold."
"Seek relics too, like the"
"Sun-Winged Aegis, for power."
"More Hints.",9
"Read Dictionary.",1
"Exit Help.",0
"9"
"Always stock Antidotes before"
"infested areas like Balthix"
"Cemetary or Turnstead Caves."
"Save Game ONLY works inside"
"buildings."
"More Hints.",10
"Read Dictionary.",1
"Exit Help.",0
"10"
"Talk to every villager, and"
"explore every corner. Watch"
"your HP in battle, and flee"
"if a fight looks grim."
"Save often. Good luck!"
"Read Hints Again.",5
"Read Dictionary.",1
"Exit Help.",0
